+  /// The academic progression system this university's colleges use unless a
+  /// college overrides it. YEAR is نظام الفرق ("First Year".."Fourth Year"),
+  /// LEVEL is نظام الليفلز ("Level 000".."Level 400").
+  ///
+  /// This is the ONLY place a university's system is recorded, and it is the
+  /// fallback every college inherits. It is deliberately independent of any
+  /// notion of government/private ownership: neither is allowed to decide it.
+  ///
+  /// Defaults to YEAR so a fresh row is a valid, inheritable configuration
+  /// rather than NULL, and so a university can never be left without an answer
+  /// for its own colleges.
+  defaultAcademicSystem AcademicStructureKind @default(YEAR)
   createdAt DateTime @default(now())
