+  /// Set when an Admin has pinned this faculty to a specific ladder, which
+  /// then wins over the one it would inherit from its university.
+  academicStructureOverride AcademicStructureFaculty?
+
+  /// The academic progression system for THIS COLLEGE ONLY.
+  ///
+  /// NULL means "inherit my university's default" — the overwhelmingly common
+  /// case, and the reason this column is nullable rather than defaulted. A
+  /// stored YEAR here and an inherited YEAR are different facts: the first is a
+  /// decision that survives a change of the university's default, the second is
+  /// a decision not to make one. Defaulting the column would collapse those two
+  /// facts together and make every college look explicitly configured.
+  ///
+  /// Copying the university's current value into this column is exactly the
+  /// mistake to avoid: it would silently freeze every existing college at its
+  /// university's present default, so the Admin could never make a
+  /// university-wide change afterwards.
+  academicSystemOverride AcademicStructureKind?
